      "content": "but \"who i am now\" is just a disappointment. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who let everyone down. it feels like i've spent twenty years building this beautiful statue, and i just shattered it. now there's just pieces on the floor. how am i supposed to just \"be myself\" when the self everyone cared about is the only one that mattered? it feels like there's no dignity in being this broken.",
