      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just that they'll always remember me as the one who had everything going for them. if i keep going like this, they're just going to watch the decline. they'll watch me struggle, watch me become this mediocre, messy version of myself until eventually there's nothing left to even care about. wouldn't it be better if the last thing they saw of me was that version they were actually proud of? instead of this slow, agonizing decay?",
